        "lang": "en",
        "markdown": "# Reliable Plumbing SBH\n\nPlumbing repairs, water heaters and pool pumps for villas and businesses across Saint-Barthélemy.\n\n## What we do\n\n- Leak detection and repair\n- Solar and electric water heater installation\n- Pool pumps, filters and salt systems\n- Bathroom and kitchen renovations\n- Water tank cleaning and cistern pumps\n- Emergency call-outs\n\n## Rates\n\nCall-out fee €70, then €80 per hour. Emergency call-outs (evenings, Sundays, holidays) €150 call-out fee. Written quotes free for jobs over €500.\n\n## Hours\n\nMonday to Friday 7am–4pm, Saturday 8am–12pm. Emergency line 24/7: +590 690 00 37 89.\n\nRun by Tom Reynolds, a licensed plumber with 18 years on the island. Fully insured (décennale).\n\n\"Tom came within the hour on a Sunday and fixed our burst pipe. Lifesaver.\" — Villa manager, Lurin\n\nreliable@plumbingsbh.example · Lorient 97133\n\nPayment by bank transfer, card or cash. Invoices in English or French.\n\n© Reliable Plumbing SBH · SIRET 000 000 000 00000"
